# `yo fix <path> --migrate unsized` with v0.2.78 over code written for
# v0.2.77, where a bare `Dyn(...)` was the owning box (decision 49 S2; the
# verdict of issues/fixed/2026-11-15-what-does-migrate-unsized-do-under-the-binary-that-flips-dyn.md).
# v0.2.78 reads its input in the v0.2.78 spelling: a by-value `Dyn` is E0619,
# so neither file evaluates, nothing is rewritten, and the run exits 1. The
# upgrade path is v0.2.77's mode, which E0619's help names:
# `yo version install 0.2.77 && yo fix <path> --migrate unsized`.
fix . --migrate unsized
